			"notes": "for minecraft 1.21.1. requires geckolib, biolith, and lib39 (also attached here, not included for technical reasons)\n\nchanges:\n- partial Connector compatibility by unilock (arcana will run and function but has known bugs)\n- improved Prismatic Light and fire orb visuals\n- added automation support for Magic Mirrors: they now output items into a storage block below them if possible, and accept items from hoppers\n- added sound effects when Magic Mirrors are used\n- added wind particles to Arcane Levitators\n- added infusion enchantment recipes to the arcanum\n\nfixes:\n- fixed missing recipes for various wood building blocks\n- fixed various wood blocks not being flammable\n- fixed warded flammable blocks being able to burn"
