			"notes": "for minecraft fabric 1.19.2. requires [geckolib](https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib/version/ATPZfRS1) and [terrablender](https://modrinth.com/mod/terrablender/version/2.0.1.166)\n\nnew:\n- reimplemented the wand focus switcher: hold F (or Swap Hands) to open, and press left/right click to cycle through foci\n- added infusion enchantment, with recipes for Runic Shielding, Projecting, Mending, Swift Sneak, and Soul Speed\n  - the Arcanum doesn't display these yet, though they do appear in EMI\n- added the Magical Forest biome, which occasionally appears around Birch Forests\n- added Huge Vishrooms and Giant Cordispora, which spawn in magical forests\n\nchanges:\n- wand foci now cost multiples of 0.1 vis, and foci costs have generally been adjusted\n- reflavoured the Cheater's Arcanum, now the Complete Arcanum, and moved it to the creative subtab\n- Taint in a Bottle now applies infestation\n- Pure Nodes now remove infestation\n- adjusted infested zone effects\n- adjusted magical tree generation, with greatwood and silverwood trees now much rarer in general\n- slightly adjusted Ordo Geode generation\n\nfixes:\n- fixed Plane Projection Ring visuals appearing in spectator mode\n- fixed Portable Hole phasing out unbreakable blocks (like bedrock, or warded blocks)\n- added some missing textures\n- fixed a crash with Yttr"
		},
